      "id": "6a7711b60000000000d0b661",
      "text": "解説",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1786188215,
      "updated": 1786188217
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7711520000000000d0b65e",
      "text": " [シーン解説/Der Untergang（ヒトラー ～最期の12日間～） - 総統閣下シリーズまとめwiki - atwiki（アットウィキ） https://w.atwiki.jp/hitler/pages/32.html]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1786188115,
      "updated": 1786188138
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7711cc0000000000d0b662",
      "text": "　[るみねあ]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1786188237,
      "updated": 1786188238
    },
    {
      "id": "6a770cc50000000000d0b64d",
      "text": "　　[https://youtu.be/OesIlpU4spg]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1786186950,
      "updated": 1786188239
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7711ac0000000000d0b65f",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1786188205,
      "updated": 1786188206
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7711d50000000000d0b663",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1786188245,
      "updated": 1786188245
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7711b00000000000d0b660",
      "text": "[語録]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1786188209,
      "updated": 1786188248
    },
    {
      "id": "6a770d460000000000d0b653",
      "text": " > „Die Generalität ist das Geschmeiss des deutschen Volkes!“",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1786187079,
      "updated": 1786204172
    },
    {
      "id": "6a770d950000000000d0b656",
      "text": " > „Sie ist ohne Ehre!“",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1786187158,
      "updated": 1786187435
    },
    {
      "id": "6a770d5e0000000000d0b655",
      "text": " 　[>_ Sie ist ohne Ehre!]──[ちくしょーめ！！]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1786187103,
      "updated": 1786187792
    },
    {
      "id": "6a770d4a0000000000d0b654",
      "text": " > „Von allem Anfang an bin ich nur verraten und betrogen worden!“",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1786187082,
      "updated": 1786204098
    },
    {
      "id": "6a770d240000000000d0b652",
      "text": "　　[>_ und betrogen worden]──[おっぱいぶるんぶるん]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1786187045,
      "updated": 1786187788
    },
    {
      "id": "6a770f670000000000d0b658",
      "text": "　> „Die gesamte Generalität ist nichts weiter als ein Haufen niederträchtiger, treuloser Feiglinge!“",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1786187624,
      "updated": 1786187760
    },
    {
      "id": "6a770f730000000000d0b659",
      "text": "　　[>_ Feiglinge!]──大っ嫌いだ！！",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1786187636,
      "updated": 1786187863
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7710560000000000d0b65b",
      "text": "　> „Ich hatte gut daren geten, vor Jahren alle höheren Offiziere liquidieren zu lassen, wie Stalin!“",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1786187863,
      "updated": 1786187976
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7710c80000000000d0b65c",
      "text": " 　[>_ Stalin!]──スターリン！",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1786187977,
      "updated": 1786188034
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7710070000000000d0b65a",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
